meta {
  name: vendors
  seq: 3
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Practice flow for the vendor actor type (`docs/study/README.md` C1,
  `agents/backend.md` "Marketplace implementation constraints").

  Run in order: register -> create -> login -> list-products ->
  create-product -> update-product. Each step saves what the next one needs
  (vendor_reg_token, vendor_id, vendor_token, vendor_product_id) as
  collection variables. `register` mints a fresh email each run, so the whole
  folder is safe to re-run from the top.

  Run `isolation/` afterwards (in the same session, without clearing
  variables) to prove a second vendor can never see or edit vendor A's
  product created here.
}
